5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's begin. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's logic carefully.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,I'm sure this will be fun! I'll be watching everyone with a very keen eye.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm gonna find the bad guy first! Just you wait!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's keep a cool head. We need to identify the werewolf and the possessed through consistent contradictions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,A simple enough premise. I'll be observing how you all attempt to hide your true natures.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is noted, but haste often leads to mistakes in these games.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, let her be, Asuka. A little energy makes the game more exciting, don't you think?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm not just energetic, I'm smart too! I'll spot a lie from a mile away!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Energy is fine, but we should focus on establishing a baseline for everyone's speaking patterns.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Indeed. The way one reacts to pressure is far more telling than their initial claims.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. I will be analyzing the flow of the conversation to find any inconsistencies.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,You're all so serious! I'm just here to enjoy the show and maybe stir things up a bit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,Stirring things up sounds like an adventure! I want to help!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@May, while enjoyment is fine, remember that we are all working toward the same goal if we are human.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Or perhaps some of us are not. The tension is where the truth usually reveals itself.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"For now, we have no evidence. I'll pass my turn.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,May,,I'm satisfied for today. Let's see what the night brings!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for the night! I hope I dream of clues!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Minako,,I have nothing further to add. Let's proceed to the night phase.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Shion,,I've seen enough for a start. I'll be waiting to see who falters tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
