32,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Everyone is still here. Since no one has died yet, we must rely on our observations from yesterday.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"Good morning, everyone! Did anyone have any interesting dreams? Or maybe a little secret to share?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I didn't dream of anything, but I feel like someone here is acting super suspicious!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, please be specific. ""Suspicious"" is a subjective term. Who exactly are you referring to?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,Let's not rush into accusations. I'm more interested in who is trying too hard to lead the conversation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, you mentioned leadership. I believe a logical approach is better than mere suspicion.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"Logic is boring, Asuka. I think we should go with our gut feelings. I have a feeling about someone...","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Rin,,Me too! I have a feeling! Maybe it's May? She's being all mysterious!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, if you have a specific suspicion, it would be more helpful to the village if you shared it now.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@May, your ""gut feeling"" is a convenient tool for a werewolf to deflect attention. How interesting.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I have confirmed that Shion is human. Therefore, we can trust their observations to some extent.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"Oh? A Seer reveals themselves so early? How bold, Asuka. Or is it a bluff to gain trust?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Wow, Asuka is the Seer! That's so cool! Does that mean we can just find the wolf now?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, if you are the Seer, please tell us who you checked. If you are lying, you've put a target on your back.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"A bold move by Asuka. Whether it's a truth or a calculated lie, it narrows the possibilities.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I am the Seer. I checked Shion and they are human. I believe we should now focus on May and Rin.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,Me? I'm just the entertainer! You're all being so mean to me today. I'm definitely a villager.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Hey! Why am I on the list? I'm just a helpful little girl! Asuka, you're mean!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minako,,"May's reactions are emotional, and Rin's are childish. Neither is definitive proof, but May's deflection is slightly more pronounced.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I agree. May's attempt to play the ""entertainer"" is a classic mask. I'll cast my vote for her.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
